From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WSL-VLA Blackwell Port <wsl-vla-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port Octo 241fb35 to JAX 0.7 / Flax 0.12 for Blackwell GPUs

- Replace removed jax.tree_map/jax.tree_leaves with jax.tree.map/leaves.
- Replace removed jax.random.KeyArray with jax.Array.
- Use process_allgather(..., tiled=True): newer JAX stacks a process axis
  for tiled=False even on one host, corrupting example-batch shapes.
- Drop distrax (incompatible with new JAX) from the discrete action head;
  jax.random.categorical samples the same distribution.
---
 octo/model/components/action_heads.py | 11 ++++++-----
 octo/model/octo_model.py              | 18 ++++++++++--------
 octo/model/octo_module.py             |  2 +-
 octo/utils/gym_wrappers.py            |  2 +-
 octo/utils/jax_utils.py               |  8 ++++----
 octo/utils/train_callbacks.py         | 12 ++++++------
 octo/utils/train_utils.py             | 12 ++++++------
 octo/utils/typing.py                  |  2 +-
 octo/utils/visualization_lib.py       |  6 +++---
 9 files changed, 38 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

